3d:["$","$Ldc","pre-9,code-0",{"source":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as Thread A\n    participant B as Thread B\n    participant C as Thread C<br/>(最后 drop)\n\n    %% 普通写入\n    A->>A: write shared data …\n    B->>B: write shared data …\n\n    %% 非最终 drop：Release 写\n    A->>A: fetch_sub (Release)  ⬅ 计数 n→n-1\n    B->>B: fetch_sub (Release)  ⬅ 计数 n-1→n-2\n\n    %% 形成 release-sequence\n    Note over A,B: 这两次 Release 写组成<br/>同一条 release-sequence\n\n    %% 最终 drop：Release 写 & 返回 1\n    C->>C: fetch_sub (Release)  ⬅ 返回 1 → 计数 0\n\n    %% Acquire fence 同步\n    C-->>C: fence (Acquire)<br/>【接收 release-sequence】\n\n    %% 安全析构\n    C->>C: drop(Box::from_raw)\n\n    %% 结果说明\n    Note over C: fence (Acquire) 使 A/B<br/>对共享数据的写必定<br/>在析构前可见"}]
